<mxCell id="body" value="&lt;b&gt;6. Body + metadata kembali ke model&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Panduan: utilisasi di atas 85% perlu diperiksa&lt;br&gt;Log dan incident memberi konteks backup, bukan kepastian" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;fontColor=#17243B;fontSize=20;spacing=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="160" y="1205" width="780" height="115" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
